  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened workplace compliance in line with international labour standards</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">During the 2024-2025 ILO programme cycle, ILO support focus on (a) improved governance of occupational safety and health through new policies and programmes  as per national priorities  and, (b)development of evidence-based wage policy  or measures for minimum wage determonation.</narrative>
  </description>
